#: scenario6:scenario6_556C1399_D7A0_4B38_A6DB_6946491A8160
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39dd7433a57d43a13d86610add87ead7ee067eaeb9fe6c482103a4e5c2965ff6
#. default-sha256: 184ffcb61c28a6c25db84412d7b67c956e9c7f67d0849f562f235bd252ae728f
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_556C1399_D7A0_4B38_A6DB_6946491A8160"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫I apologize for making you listen to my dreadful stories for so long. "
"⟪k:38⟫You must be quite weary of them by now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫――오랫동안 ⟪k:38⟫이런 미친 이야기를 들려 드려서 ⟪k:39⟫죄송해요. ⟪k:40⟫많"
"이 피곤하시죠."

#: scenario6:scenario6_22E7D063_B796_4594_A606_5DBD3B193E2D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b7ecb6d88bca684b645fb9fc92ab3ff99b061ad64dbc06daba88664b38c19dc
#. default-sha256: 6c47fa575a44d9e00bc4ca76235d57766ebdd5ea0d791b1b3abb58533e82b85c
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_22E7D063_B796_4594_A606_5DBD3B193E2D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But worry not, for this is the final one."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래도 ⟪k:1⟫이게 마지막이에요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_5FFD9067_E11D_4279_AA9B_4F0DC72D8A27
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b24aba6c1e65aab51a4893132d570c1ed4e86931bd093279794fa5f5d915905
#. default-sha256: 84aea88df66426962d4122f8efcb8b90222dd97025fe3af381a14ff8452307eb
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_5FFD9067_E11D_4279_AA9B_4F0DC72D8A27"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And despite being the end, it is neither dramatic nor exciting."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그리고 ⟪k:1⟫마지막임에도 ⟪k:2⟫극적인 끝이지도 않아요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_72F9EB16_EAA9_4710_9482_6C51B1F9FC15
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47372cb8b1b8b42bc7574529b9330328a7c24e24291ec00f3bcf118c3ca7e81f
#. default-sha256: 3b6fb634e77de14053322e26ee183e9ceb661812ca78a16d75e70baee42783c2
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_72F9EB16_EAA9_4710_9482_6C51B1F9FC15"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was a single phrase—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the most insignificant of things—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제가 완전히 저를 잃고, ⟪k:1⟫제가 지젤이란 인간이었단 사실마저 잊게 한 건――"

#: scenario6:scenario6_076A4C37_956A_4FC0_B6F2_2CEC0EEF1EB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1c0f0f88a93287c423e1e02c280460462252bcda7e418792e6c98f3e44652f0
#. default-sha256: 24ae855e91a7051ca0c46c049e1a4f63686336076f01ce8a6b407467f79fb15a
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_076A4C37_956A_4FC0_B6F2_2CEC0EEF1EB9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫that caused me to completely lose myself and forget I had, long ago, been the woman called "
"Giselle."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫별 것도 아닌 ⟪k:1⟫단 한마디였거든요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_FF896C7C_8BFE_4088_A051_EDE1EE66FF96
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e24b1578829e49bd93208e2f51104ee045a67895b7ec713e82420019471787d
#. default-sha256: e2e41b00eddb74d4f68ccdfd3f6b75264bbb2aa9702e81fda7a33562431c1556
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_FF896C7C_8BFE_4088_A051_EDE1EE66FF96"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫There was no malice in it. ⟪k:1⟫It was but a simple greeting."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어떠한 악의도 없으며, ⟪k:1⟫별 뜻도 없는 ⟪k:2⟫인사말이었죠."

#: scenario6:scenario6_53347EC4_B414_492B_993D_8757F2C0E14B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91ee6f752ef254a0fbd91ff473b08eedc1dc919711829e73ae6562a4f53c588f
#. default-sha256: 4b5e42b4396ed3ca7ba0303b311e753ac2ebc03427cfbfb329fcced0400a2d9c
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_53347EC4_B414_492B_993D_8757F2C0E14B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Do you remember how, the first time she arrived,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫저기, ⟪k:3⟫기억하시나요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_10F6EC42_4F81_46A1_BC78_36A8A802846B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77a4a8af179381b250a774b02305638aae5bef929b47112d445a64e0f44e601b
#. default-sha256: e3f4abe6a72b5dfd6e1c374d15dafcf5e000268d2da0dbfe82852c1cca509e0d
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_10F6EC42_4F81_46A1_BC78_36A8A802846B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Michel” said I had a peculiar presence about me?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She felt something there between "
"us."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫소녀는 처음으로 저를 봤을 때, ⟪k:1⟫신비로운 분위기를 ⟪k:2⟫풍긴다고 했어요. ⟪k:3⟫저를 보고 "
"⟪k:4⟫무슨 인상이나마 느끼긴 한 거죠."

#: scenario6:scenario6_FEA9E9B7_5E6D_4C21_8873_F2ABE720FA54
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e6b1d2bbf3243725446acba6fb7dff8522d68be183a072571192d2e2700997d
#. default-sha256: 8264ba2c56355a14eb24fa973a7a83325d134590e01b8369ebe1a0c04554d6b1
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_FEA9E9B7_5E6D_4C21_8873_F2ABE720FA54"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And the second time, she said something about me seemed familiar.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She did not "
"remember why, but her soul recognized the bonds we shared."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 다음 번에는 ⟪k:1⟫그립다고 ⟪k:2⟫했어요. ⟪k:3⟫기억은 못 해도 ⟪k:4⟫소녀의 혼이 저와 맺힌 연"
"을 이해했죠."

#: scenario6:scenario6_F06992C8_18FF_4B48_8EA8_D9231880549E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2df1d15c494b37baf57fd7306b2aa766a50caa1c6ef3ea0699212aef70185f67
#. default-sha256: 1fc99d975fc1e839b3eccd1bcfd2e2a1ba57f0bf4300b9dcc12e3cb6de11cd31
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_F06992C8_18FF_4B48_8EA8_D9231880549E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So I assumed that the next time she showed up, she would feel something even stronger, ⟪k:1⟫"
"or perhaps even have her memories."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그러니 ⟪k:1⟫세 번째는…… 더욱 깊은 연결성을 기억하진 않을지. ⟪k:2⟫혹은 ⟪k:3⟫과거를 떠올리진 않"
"았을지――"

#: scenario6:scenario6_1051D477_1775_45A0_8D7B_5C6294BD13D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69cd144b50b447e287473a7d68b5144e81a062f14f04c45d1fe5f2391d6bdfe3
#. default-sha256: bfc9828f71bd2f9d22fcc757fba2ef1ca60c1a537df26a5eb041309efef15a1f
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_1051D477_1775_45A0_8D7B_5C6294BD13D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite having been let down again and again, I still held on to the faintest glimmer of "
"hope."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫여러 번 절망했음에도 ⟪k:1⟫마지막 순간까지 ⟪k:2⟫그런 한 줌 희망을 품었어요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_5D0DB885_0ECC_4ECB_9B27_6A1CF4DE51C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7181e9dfb6d294dd305bcdf6edc24d0c137d91c856c2731765be7ebc0ef71047
#. default-sha256: f6e9a9bad623ca909f612759c340482ae1c8b00b075ec805867bf5457b392632
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_5D0DB885_0ECC_4ECB_9B27_6A1CF4DE51C3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But when she appeared, ⟪k:1⟫she was someone else’s wife."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫그 시대의 소녀는―― ⟪k:2⟫처음부터 다른 남자의 아내였어요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_CCAA917E_5CB3_4728_BF9E_D35A17A92BF1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d17417796fe5d359cf4d193ba7b564b9ae8628bf3f773679561d5f5e068716a
#. default-sha256: bf2e76dfe65c566bd0e87e25315a0b7300bb29938ac182fe7b38f3bd7b0566c2
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_CCAA917E_5CB3_4728_BF9E_D35A17A92BF1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hey! Hey, head maid!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Get out here!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫이봐――, ⟪k:3⟫이봐! ⟪k:4⟫메이드장! ⟪k:5⟫메이드장 있나!"

#: scenario6:scenario6_B9FFC48D_8468_4417_89FD_3726CB41A310
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2fbe5f51b1fbb3d20b04e54c41dcdadadca40ab989c658ad1192e0e3dc4f76af
#. default-sha256: e970016ac9e721f34a3db9430dbe6705697fee9507548858fb4f480d0ae1da8b
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_B9FFC48D_8468_4417_89FD_3726CB41A310"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I am right here, sir.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Is something the matter?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……네, ⟪k:3⟫여기 있답니다. ⟪k:4⟫그렇게 큰 목소리로 찾으시다니, ⟪k:5⟫어쩐 일이신지요?"

#: scenario6:scenario6_03232306_DBE0_4747_B3FA_10B5730DBEB3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 44cb520e177ca36e609d85225fc3e2a7b2262d09ec07375c4bffb9006f57782f
#. default-sha256: 2a4f8ca7664383547316cabc9ae793ae766bae2725c97648de07b4919662b7e8
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_03232306_DBE0_4747_B3FA_10B5730DBEB3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I figured you should get to know her as soon as possible,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫since you’ll be "
"spending a lot of time looking after her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫메이드장에게 먼저 소개해야겠다 ⟪k:3⟫싶었거든.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫앞으로 오래 알고 지낼 거 아"
"니야."

#: scenario6:scenario6_D13813BA_B5BC_4EC9_A313_D3F0B67349BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4bdb0076e3db001c9a356d0433d4150d0c9c7fd93eda3b9ebc9bb547cc4421c
#. default-sha256: 902b45b4b59aad4f22bcb96c2ce422fdb72fcb6abaf72a544d5afccb91f7225c
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D13813BA_B5BC_4EC9_A313_D3F0B67349BD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………?"

#: scenario6:scenario6_16E316EF_B176_4919_8842_25639A4FFD25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70f270f1550a1d47027a70680227ce8cc52a09d0da45bef62b9bc04e3a303276
#. default-sha256: e8ca6010c400ad3a32f204da6f5fcee87c2eda2b29984f304280761f23558620
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_16E316EF_B176_4919_8842_25639A4FFD25"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hey, get out here!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Christ, there’s not a goddamned confident bone in your "
"body, is there?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫이봐, ⟪k:2⟫이리로 와! ⟪k:3⟫나 참, ⟪k:4⟫너는 정말 굼뜨군."

#: scenario6:scenario6_14684D65_8FA9_4010_953A_C2D2C8D024EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4a5f2bd1b75dc9ee6974169dd1186c41df2eb494ae6e79c9560ce688e4311a2
#. default-sha256: 3f61e9b757d7d4c8d700d15af668f47eeeb5774fc77c4477dde997f13023de61
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_14684D65_8FA9_4010_953A_C2D2C8D024EC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ah, ⟪k:3⟫I-⟪k:4⟫I’m sorry... ⟪k:5⟫I’ll be right out!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫앗, ⟪k:3⟫죄, ⟪k:4⟫죄송해요……, ⟪k:5⟫지금 갈게요……!"

#: scenario6:scenario6_E7BB3F86_5C78_42D9_A0E8_5D77D70DB695
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aaaf7481a32c0b77c1e68e91878e9107a9afdd3aa2dec91dd0e0fb2c8a7a061e
#. default-sha256: 7b647c048bf19264a672a0f576d123d8c9044346459dd757cc75e5f8c26fd98f
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_E7BB3F86_5C78_42D9_A0E8_5D77D70DB695"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫…………!"

#: scenario6:scenario6_49BC5947_A133_4885_A7D0_F9CCD63F605C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9dd47808bffe6dd3b629234e73a11e7aa2468c8397eaec68bd74a6fbb477e5f
#. default-sha256: 7a503776b7ee534d672efb983fe5f7933626c1fc2d6c459486d41b774156dbca
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_49BC5947_A133_4885_A7D0_F9CCD63F605C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Mi—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………………미, ⟪k:2⟫…………."

#: scenario6:scenario6_8CE9F3FD_FF79_4F19_9C53_3646DD9D5407
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 897f26597babde92605073b62d8c425610413a1a0c73cb36807d911e7f01d144
#. default-sha256: 0204e8b78eb63675e8d9f3a4fcbe1fb35ee0dc3b21999bcf78022f3104a81c98
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_8CE9F3FD_FF79_4F19_9C53_3646DD9D5407"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The first thing she said when she saw me was,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그리고 소녀는 ⟪k:1⟫저와 마주한 순간, ⟪k:2⟫이 말을 했어요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_05C8C434_3889_4466_9C5F_9C967728EF84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ed753a17a67e76a9fb9fbaaa2b7292042b7ec07a40f5d2ad6c6bf8b49c4174d
#. default-sha256: a75b69731b373ced63ef454afb6d0049b2cc1931c17aa5cba0f03cafa96e1d9d
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_05C8C434_3889_4466_9C5F_9C967728EF84"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s a pleasure to meet you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫처음 뵙겠습니다."

#: scenario6:scenario6_083071E8_9111_45AE_8A4B_D0C4122FF24C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c0335e8af351ec90c5cfa3eb51f90e443d212d6b44596c5e759ed0f3e40e9f6c
#. default-sha256: a75b69731b373ced63ef454afb6d0049b2cc1931c17aa5cba0f03cafa96e1d9d
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_083071E8_9111_45AE_8A4B_D0C4122FF24C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“It’s a pleasure to meet you.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫처음 뵙겠습니다."

